# 🌤️ Weather Information Dashboard

A sleek, responsive, and real-time weather dashboard built using vanilla JavaScript, standard CSS3, and the OpenWeatherMap API.

## 🚀 Live Demo
- **Live App:** https://teja200401.github.io/weather-dashboard/

## ✨ Features
- **Real-Time Weather Data:** Fetches temperature, conditions, humidity, and wind speed for any valid city.
- **Loading & Error Handling:** Displays active loading indicators during requests and user-friendly error messages for invalid entries.
- **Geolocation Support:** Retrieves local weather automatically via browser GPS permission.
- **Recent Search History:** Saves recently searched cities in LocalStorage as quick-search tags.
- **Dark / Light Mode:** Dynamic theme switcher for optimal visibility across system settings.
- **Fully Responsive:** Styled using modern CSS Flexbox and media queries for mobile, tablet, and desktop views.

## 🛠️ Tech Stack
- **Frontend:** HTML5, CSS3, JavaScript (ES6+ / Async-Await / DOM API)
- **API:** OpenWeatherMap API
- **Storage:** HTML5 LocalStorage

